From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sunnymar <sunnym@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 20:15:31 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Add external slot and object fuse compiler hooks

Permuted property slots and object fuse notifications for the external
tier, the shell testing functions that observe them, and their
jit-tests.

Source commits in YurtOS/firefox (yurt dff5cf534448):
  95b9f31de072 test: cover external compiler permuted property slots
    (all included paths except js/src/tests/lib)
  a1d957648b20 test: require external tier object fuse notifications
    (all included paths except js/src/tests/lib)
  a2e0c4dc9fd0 feat: import external slot and object fuse compiler hooks
    (all included paths except js/src/tests/lib)
  ff2bc3770cef test: observe invalidation of a consumed prototype chain
    (all included paths except js/src/tests/lib)
  ec6c586a7e18 test: expose bounded external fuse observer in the shell
    (all included paths except js/src/tests/lib)
  1df0e02d6c95 test: reproduce lost permuted slots in compatible-object copying
    (all included paths except js/src/tests/lib)
  65e96085dce8 test: reproduce Object.assign bypass of external slot hooks
    (all included paths except js/src/tests/lib)
  2b415d0e5bc5 test: preserve enumerable flags in ordinary compatible copies
    (all included paths except js/src/tests/lib)
  a92a5b2dc24c fix: preserve permuted and enumerable flags when reusing property maps
    (all included paths except js/src/tests/lib)
  e57dacabd598 fix: honor external tier hooks during bulk property assignment
    (all included paths except js/src/tests/lib)
  f850071eda00 style: format external compiler testing fixtures
    (all included paths except js/src/tests/lib)
